 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "往里一环，是依赖包。",
   "spoken": "往里一环，是依赖包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.928,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.698
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "一个前端会引用很多别人写的代码包，大多来自 npm 仓库。",
   "spoken": "一个前端会引用很多别人写的代码包，大多来自 npm 仓库。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.748,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 4.846,
   "speechEnd": 9.155
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "攻击者先钓鱼包的维护者，拿到账号或者会话。",
   "spoken": "攻击者先钓鱼包的维护者，拿到账号或者会话。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.224,
   "dur": 4.464,
   "speechStart": 10.322,
   "speechEnd": 13.857
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "再发布一个带恶意代码的新版本。",
   "spoken": "再发布一个带恶意代码的新版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.908,
   "dur": 3.216,
   "speechStart": 15.006,
   "speechEnd": 17.291
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "如果 DApp 不锁版本，下次构建就会拉进这个新版本。",
   "spoken": "如果 DApp 不锁版本，下次构建就会拉进这个新版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 18.344,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 18.442,
   "speechEnd": 22.751
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "恶意代码挂到钱包接口上，替换收款地址，或者弹出授权。",
   "spoken": "恶意代码挂到钱包接口上，替换收款地址，或者弹出授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.796,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 23.894,
   "speechEnd": 28.691
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "2023 年 12 月，Ledger 的一名前员工被钓鱼。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 12 月，Ledger 的一名前员工被钓鱼。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.752,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 29.85,
   "speechEnd": 33.838
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "Ledger 回收了他的其他权限，唯独漏了 npm。",
   "spoken": "Ledger 回收了他的其他权限，唯独漏了 npm。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 34.892,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 34.99,
   "speechEnd": 38.93
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "攻击者用他的会话，先后发布 3 个恶意版本的 Connect Kit。",
   "spoken": "攻击者用他的会话，先后发布 3 个恶意版本的 Connect Kit。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.984,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 40.082,
   "speechEnd": 44.748
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "很多 DApp 直接从 CDN 加载最新版，恶意代码直接进了它们的页面。",
   "spoken": "很多 DApp 直接从 CDN 加载最新版，恶意代码直接进了它们的页面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.82,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 45.918,
   "speechEnd": 50.977
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "Ledger 约 40 分钟内发布了修复版本。",
   "spoken": "Ledger 约 40 分钟内发布了修复版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 52.04,
   "dur": 3.864,
   "speechStart": 52.138,
   "speechEnd": 55.066
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "但 CDN 的缓存，让恶意文件约 5 小时后才完全清除，损失约 60 万美元。",
   "spoken": "但 CDN 的缓存，让恶意文件约 5 小时后才完全清除，损失约 60 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 56.124,
   "dur": 7.152,
   "speechStart": 56.222,
   "speechEnd": 62.424
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "2025 年 9 月，chalk 和 debug 等 18 个包被投毒，周下载量合计超过 20 亿。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 9 月，chalk 和 debug 等 18 个包被投毒，周下载量合计超过 20 亿。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 63.496,
   "dur": 7.248,
   "speechStart": 63.594,
   "speechEnd": 69.915
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "已确认的加密损失很小，但一个包能进入的页面，多到无法统计。",
   "spoken": "已确认的加密损失很小，但一个包能进入的页面，多到无法统计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 70.964,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 71.062,
   "speechEnd": 75.895
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "再往里，是 CDN。",
   "spoken": "再往里，是 CDN。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 76.944,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "speechStart": 77.042,
   "speechEnd": 79.113
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "CDN 把文件缓存到各地的边缘节点，就近发给用户。",
   "spoken": "CDN 把文件缓存到各地的边缘节点，就近发给用户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 80.164,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 80.262,
   "speechEnd": 84.44
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "边缘节点上也能运行脚本，改写发出去的页面。",
   "spoken": "边缘节点上也能运行脚本，改写发出去的页面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 85.496,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 85.594,
   "speechEnd": 89.201
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "2021 年，攻击者利用 Cloudflare 注册流程的一个漏洞。",
   "spoken": "2021 年，攻击者利用 Cloudflare 注册流程的一个漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 90.252,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 90.35,
   "speechEnd": 94.219
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "拿到 BadgerDAO 账号下，一把未经授权的 API Key。",
   "spoken": "拿到 BadgerDAO 账号下，一把未经授权的 API Key。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 95.272,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 95.37,
   "speechEnd": 99.251
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "从 11 月起，他通过边缘脚本，定期往页面里注入代码，只对部分用户弹出授权。",
   "spoken": "从 11 月起，他通过边缘脚本，定期往页面里注入代码，只对部分用户弹出授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
   "start": 100.316,
   "dur": 7.464,
   "speechStart": 100.414,
   "speechEnd": 106.937
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "12 月 2 日，攻击者用这些授权，转走约 1 亿 2000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "12 月 2 日，攻击者用这些授权，转走约 1 亿 2000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-20.mp3",
   "start": 108.0,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 108.098,
   "speechEnd": 112.848
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "这两环的防线，先锁定全部依赖版本，不从 CDN 加载最新版的库。",
   "spoken": "这两环的防线，先锁定全部依赖版本，不从 CDN 加载最新版的库。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-21.mp3",
   "start": 113.908,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 114.006,
   "speechEnd": 119.398
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "外部脚本加上子资源完整性校验，哈希不对就不执行。",
   "spoken": "外部脚本加上子资源完整性较验，哈希不对就不执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-22.mp3",
   "start": 120.464,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 120.562,
   "speechEnd": 125.002
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-23",
   "text": "发布凭证用短期的，有人离职，当天回收所有发布渠道。",
   "spoken": "发布凭证用短期的，有人离职，档天回收所有发布渠道。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg4-23.mp3",
   "start": 126.06,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 126.158,
   "speechEnd": 130.574
  },
  {
